"Windowed Entryway"
"Panes of green-colored glass surround you on all sides of this small, ten feet

by ten feet entryway.  The ceiling itself is also made of the greenish glass,

nearly thirty feet overhead.  Sliding doors lead out of the greenhouse to the

west and into its interior to the east.

"
