#44501
"Inside the Greenhouse - Small Potted Plants"
"This large, expansive section of the greenhouse is filled with tables holding

nearly two hundred potted plants and flowers of all varieties.  The room

measures approximately fifty feet in length and width, with the sloped green-

glass ceiling about sixty-five feet overhead.  A sliding glass door leads to

the greenhouse's entryway to the west and a small glass-enclosed hallway leads

east out of the room.  Above that eastern exit a large, prominent sign hangs

conspicuously.

"
