"Yellow Brick Path"
"This narrow path of sandstone bricks leads up to a building of green-colored

glass to the east and to a clearing in the sand to the west.  The small yellow

brick road is well-kept and clean, but one brick seems to be out of place.  A

small sign hangs off a sliding glass door which enters the greenhouse to the

east.

"
