"Inside the Greenhouse - Predatory Daisy"
"The glass which encloses this enormous room is tinted a bright shade of

yellow, probably to suit whatever plant is kept here.  A few empty barrels sit

in the corners of this room, apparently used to hold water for its inhabitant

as one is still damp.  A sliding glass door leads out of the room to the west.

