#44507
"Inside the Greenhouse - Plant Beast"
"The glass of the greenhouse walls are much thicker here than elsewhere, and

has thousands and thousands of tiny spores embedded into its panes.  The

shattered remains of a few water barrels lie smashed against the southern

wall, hurled by some powerful force.  A sliding glass door leads north out of

the large room.

"
"[Elfir] This thing's definately more powerful than it's level indicates

what level you do you think it is?

