"Balloon Landing Area"
"A perfect circle of large red rocks surround this flat section of sand, a

marker from the ground as a fixture of guidance from above.  A short path of

yellow brick leads east towards a large building of green-colored glass.  A

small sign is staked into the ground nearby, beside a small silver bell.

"
"[Phule] habib is room 36186

